  "bodyHash": "097478f31c48a240",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkotacraft.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_2f704c1a-1d1a-4dd4-9f59-cd63d95533e7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"285\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253dU3X4XNKXC2BT8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_10294876-571e-4121-89cb-cab601b0cf4a.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"32\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.kotacraft.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_6e44cfbf-cc0c-4da4-9fd8-d63ab3aa9af7.png\" width=\"125\" height=\"32\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkotacraft.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_2f3675a3-0e7b-40be-a4ec-f3e9dea897c8.png\" width=\"127\" height=\"32\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_391e827b-820c-49fc-bd86-85c674f6ca3f.png\"></h1>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Это модиакет находится в разработке. Сообщите о любых проблемах.</strong></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">KOTACRAFT — это модиакет, предназначенный для того, чтобы дать игрокам чувство исследования и приключения, а также提供一些元素的RPG风格体验。它还包含各种用于图形增强和性能优化的模组，并有一个<LITE>选项，该选项移除高消耗图形的功能。<br>随着Minecraft 1.21模组的发布，此包将持续更新。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_89624914-0e2e-4938-965c-53e9ff4d4d32.png\"></strong></h1>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>轻量版中移除了所有资源包以获得更好性能</strong></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">自定义KOTACRAFT资源包，包含多种更改<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">新鲜动画</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/human-player-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\">人类村民X新鲜动画</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_d7f5b3b4-51f0-47da-bd03-9e157b1af21b.png\"></strong></h1>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>*标记的模组在轻量版中被移除以优化性能</strong></h6>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irisshaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris*</a>的美丽着色器<br>自定义<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-unbound\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complimentary*</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/euphoria-patches\" rel=\"nofollow\">Euphoria*</a>设置<br>自定义<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/bsl-shaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSL</a>*设置<br>通过<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Haubna\" rel=\"nofollow\">物理mod^</a>实现惊人的图形设置<br>借助<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">落叶飘落</a>呈现如画般的场景<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">环境音效</a>带来沉浸式游戏体验<br><br><br></p>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">请注意：</span>Physics Mod Pro不能在modpack中重新分发，但我们已为其提供了配置文件。<br><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Haubna\" rel=\"nofollow\">请访问Haubna的Patreon页面</a>免费获取该模组并手动添加到本modpack中。<br>此外，建议在Patreon上支持Haubna的创作！</strong></h6>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_ea1fb526-9049-4adf-88a3-df7d4db13f47.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>显卡：至少需要一块支持OpenGL 2+的显卡</strong><br><strong>内存：视频处理建议至少4 GB RAM，但推荐8 GB或更多</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_ad832182-f756-496a-a24a-87dcc8221d3e.png\"></p>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>截图中展示的海洋物理效果未默认包含在此modpack中。<br>请<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Haubna\" rel=\"nofollow\">访问Haubna的Patreon页面</a>免费下载该模组并手动添加到此modpack中。</strong></h6>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_02d1fc44-d373-44ce-a9d9-1fc98562f815.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"214\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_44b4d580-0561-4651-9ad7-b17efed18b4f.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"214\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_17577b84-d388-4585-9c4b-007dc97c021b.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"214\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_c146088a-0133-4df5-9a1b-18a0df345720.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"214\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_cf7ed1e7-61d8-4209-912e-ddcdeda46d6f.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"214\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_9f607fee-2054-445e-a036-ba76ecc00f43.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"214\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_a3161526-882f-419e-ba58-3f9d79e45572.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"214\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_2943d4e2-b5c7-4be6-823b-b2c9adb0ee82.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"214\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_244f2b19-d49d-44db-980c-67bee3b8dd25.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"214\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_b8b7425a-fb74-422f-a527-77c63c8caecf.png\" width=\"380\" height=\"214\"><br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_ca678312-270f-4238-bfcf-16627b1bd335.png\"></strong></h1>\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>*标记的模组在轻量版中被移除以优化性能</strong></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">[EMF] 实体模型特性 [Fabric & Forge]</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">[ETF] 实体纹理特征 - [Fabric & Forge]</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">AmbientSounds 6</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API (Fabric/Forge/NeoForge)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/athena\" rel=\"nofollow\">Athena</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm (Fabric版)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-than-mending\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的附魔修复</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterf3\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterF3*</a><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chat-heads\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chat Heads*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chat-signing-hider\" rel=\"nofollow\">聊天签名隐藏器</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisel-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisel Reborn</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cicada/files/5430768\" rel=\"nofollow\">CICADA*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API (Fabric/Forge/NeoForge)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/controlling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Controlling</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftpresence\" rel=\"nofollow\">Craft Presence</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cull-leaves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cull Leaves</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cursorcentered-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">CursorCentered Fix</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/default-options-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">默认选项 (Fabric版)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/detail-armor-bar\" rel=\"nofollow\">Detail Armor Bar [Fabric]</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/do-a-barrel-roll/files/5444457\" rel=\"nofollow\">来个桶滚*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-tools-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易翡翠工具及更多[FABRIC]</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">进食动画</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhancedvisuals\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enhanced Visuals*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entityculling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Culling Fabric/Forge</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/euphoria-patches\" rel=\"nofollow\">Euphoria Patches*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric语言Kotlin</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">落叶飘落(Fabric)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/faux-custom-entity-data\" rel=\"nofollow\">伪造自定义实体数据*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge配置API移植</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" rel=\"nofollow\">GlitchCore</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gobber [FABRIC]</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/head-in-the-clouds\" rel=\"nofollow\">云端头脑*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/idwtialsimmoedm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Idwtialsimmoedm</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/indium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Indium</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irisshaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris Shaders*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/macaws-bridges\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw的桥梁</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组菜单</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/music-delay-reducer\" rel=\"nofollow\">音乐延迟减少器</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/music-notification\" rel=\"nofollow\">音乐通知*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">不止动画</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paginated-advancements\" rel=\"nofollow\">分页式进展与自定义框架</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Items Fabric/Forge/NeoForge(REI)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/searchables\" rel=\"nofollow\">可搜索物品</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shoulder-surfing-reloaded\" rel=\"nofollow\">肩拍视角重制版</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-backpack-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">简易背包[FABRIC]</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skin-layers-3d\" rel=\"nofollow\">皮肤图层3D</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structory\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structory</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/structory-towers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structory: Tower</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/talkbubbles\" rel=\"nofollow\">TalkBubbles</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tax-free-levels\" rel=\"nofollow\">Безналоговые уровни (Fabric/(Neo)Forge)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">TerraBlender (Fabric)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/text-placeholder-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Text Placeholder API</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tiny-item-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Т微小的物品动画</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toast-manager\" rel=\"nofollow\">Менеджер тостов</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/transmog\" rel=\"nofollow\">Трансмог</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trofers/files/5444384\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trofers</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Вешалки (версия Fabric)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" rel=\"nofollow\">Миникарта Xaero*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map\" rel=\"nofollow\">Карта мира Xaero*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeroplus\" rel=\"nofollow\">XaeroPlus*</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yacl\" rel=\"nofollow\">YetAnotherConfigLib</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/your-reputation-jade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ваша репутация (Jade)</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1038858/description_6af2f96f-8479-4849-bf1c-c5c6065bab94.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
